PN,34201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785484078
OL,3,CTraffic can kill almost a third of
OL,4,Chedgehogs according to Nottinghamshire
OL,5,Cstudy
OL,7,FRoad traffic can kill almost a third
OL,8,Fof hedgehogs ` and could push smaller
OL,9,Fpopulations towards local extinction,
OL,10,Fa study led by Nottingham Trent
OL,11,FUniversity has shown.
OL,13,FA team studied four local hedgehog
OL,14,Fpopulations of varying sizes in
OL,15,FNottinghamshire to see what the effect
OL,16,Fof road kills were on the animals'
OL,17,Fnumbers.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785484078
OL,3,CTraffic can kill almost a third of
OL,4,Chedgehogs according to Nottinghamshire
OL,5,Cstudy
OL,7,FThe study found that road traffic
OL,8,Fkilled between 15% and 29% of
OL,9,Fhedgehogs in local populations each
OL,10,Fyear, and was the main cause of
OL,11,Frecorded hedgehog deaths, responsible
OL,12,Ffor around two fifths (38-41%) of all
OL,13,Fidentified mortality.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785484078
OL,3,CTraffic can kill almost a third of
OL,4,Chedgehogs according to Nottinghamshire
OL,5,Cstudy
OL,7,FBut while larger hedgehog populations
OL,8,F` despite having more traffic-related
OL,9,Fdeaths ` were able to offset their
OL,10,Flosses, even a small amount of
OL,11,Froadkill each year could have a
OL,12,Fsignificant impact on smaller
OL,13,Fpopulations, potentially pushing them
OL,14,Fto be wiped out.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785484078
OL,3,CTraffic can kill almost a third of
OL,4,Chedgehogs according to Nottinghamshire
OL,5,Cstudy
OL,7,FThe conservation scientists, whose
OL,8,Fresearch was funded by the British
OL,9,FHedgehog Preservation Society and
OL,10,FPeople's Trust for Endangered Species,
OL,11,Fsaid their research showed the
OL,12,Fimportance of bolstering smaller
OL,13,Fpopulations so they can better
OL,14,Fwithstand traffic deaths.
OL,16,FConservationists warn hedgehogs in
OL,17,FBritain have undergone long term
OL,18,Fdeclines.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785484078
OL,3,CTraffic can kill almost a third of
OL,4,Chedgehogs according to Nottinghamshire
OL,5,Cstudy
OL,7,FA range of factors are affecting their
OL,8,Fsurvival, from an impoverished
OL,9,Flandscape with a loss of habitat and
OL,10,Finvertebrates to issues such as
OL,11,Fpredation by badgers and foxes,
OL,12,Fpoisoning by insecticides and injury
OL,13,Ffrom farming and garden machinery and
OL,14,Froad vehicles.
OL,16,FRural hedgehogs have seen numbers fall
OL,17,Fby an estimated 30-75% since 2000,
OL,18,Falthough the picture for urban animals
OL,19,Fis one of a population that has
OL,20,Fstabilised and may be recovering.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785484078
OL,3,CTraffic can kill almost a third of
OL,4,Chedgehogs according to Nottinghamshire
OL,5,Cstudy
OL,7,FFor their study, published in the
OL,8,Fjournal Animal Conservation, the
OL,9,Fscientists studied four hedgehog
OL,10,Fpopulations in villages and towns in
OL,11,FNottinghamshire, surrounded by arable
OL,12,Ffields and pastures, which were
OL,13,Fselected to be representative of
OL,14,Fhabitat and road deaths.
OL,16,FThe researchers walked 838km of survey
OL,17,Froutes (520 miles), measuring
OL,18,Fpopulation size, as well as
OL,19,Freproductive rates and adult and
OL,20,Fjuvenile hedgehog survival rates.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785484078
OL,3,CTraffic can kill almost a third of
OL,4,Chedgehogs according to Nottinghamshire
OL,5,Cstudy
OL,7,FThey also completed 269 roadkill
OL,8,Fsurveys over 18 months, in which they
OL,9,Faimed to find every hedgehog killed on
OL,10,Fthe roads within and between the study
OL,11,Fsites, recording the location and sex
OL,12,Fof those found.
OL,14,FThe data were used to estimate how
OL,15,Froad deaths could affect the survival
OL,16,Fof hedgehog populations, particularly
OL,17,Fwith expected rising levels of UK
OL,18,Ftraffic.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785484078
OL,3,CTraffic can kill almost a third of
OL,4,Chedgehogs according to Nottinghamshire
OL,5,Cstudy
OL,7,FThe study found that larger
OL,8,Fpopulations had more traffic-related
OL,9,Fdeaths, but were able to offset these
OL,10,Fwith higher reproductive rates and the
OL,11,Ffact that most of those killed were
OL,12,Fmales rather than females.
OL,14,FBut with smaller populations that had
OL,15,Ffewer than 15 individual hedgehogs,
OL,16,Feven a low number of deaths could have
OL,17,Fa significant impact, pushing them
OL,18,Ffaster towards local extinction.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785484078
OL,3,CTraffic can kill almost a third of
OL,4,Chedgehogs according to Nottinghamshire
OL,5,Cstudy
OL,7,FLead researcher Dr Lauren Moore, who
OL,8,Fwas based in Nottingham Trent
OL,9,FUniversity's School of Animal, Rural
OL,10,Fand Environmental Sciences at the time
OL,11,Fof the study, said: "Hedgehogs are
OL,12,Fdeclining in the UK and we have found
OL,13,Fhow even a small amount of roadkill `
OL,14,Fperhaps just one or two individuals a
OL,15,Fyear ` could have devastating effects
OL,16,Fon an already small population.
OL,26,@sD@UOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G9/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785484078
OL,3,CTraffic can kill almost a third of
OL,4,Chedgehogs according to Nottinghamshire
OL,5,Cstudy
OL,7,F"In the past, research has assumed
OL,8,Fthat high roadkill rates have a large
OL,9,Fand negative impact on hedgehog
OL,10,Fpopulations and that a small amount
OL,11,Fdoes little harm.
OL,13,F"This does not tell us the full
OL,14,Fpicture and in fact populations vary a
OL,15,Flot in terms of size, reproductive
OL,16,Frates, other causes of death and food
OL,17,Favailability.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G10/11
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1785484078
OL,3,CTraffic can kill almost a third of
OL,4,Chedgehogs according to Nottinghamshire
OL,5,Cstudy
OL,7,F"We need to better support hedgehog
OL,8,Fpopulations until there are tried and
OL,9,Ftested ways to reduce collisions
OL,10,Fhappening in the first place."
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@^O]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G11/11
